Format Transceiver — Non-Commercial License
=============================================

This project's feature scope and conversion coverage were inspired by
FlyingMouse Format (飞鼠格式) by LaoFeng (牢蜂):
https://github.com/LaoFeng-mouse/flyingmouse-format

All code in this repository is an independent, browser-only reimplementation
(WebAssembly / client-side JavaScript) and does not reuse FlyingMouse
Format's source code, which targets a Node.js/Electron desktop environment
with bundled native binaries. In keeping with the spirit and terms of that
project's own non-commercial license — which permits personal use,
redistribution, and derivative work as long as attribution is kept and the
result stays non-commercial — this project is released under the same
restrictions:

1. Personal, non-commercial use, copying, and modification of this project
   are free and permitted.
2. Commercial use is PROHIBITED: selling, reselling, charging for access,
   embedding in a paid product, or any other commercial exploitation.
3. Redistribution or forks must keep this notice and the attribution above
   to FlyingMouse Format / LaoFeng (牢蜂).
4. The software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind.

